# Pinned developer tools (ADR-012 D12.4; AGENTS.md:13). `just doctor` compares
# what is installed with this file and exits non-zero on any difference.
#
#   <tool> <version> [<since>]
#
# rustc, node and python must also agree with the files their own tools read
# (rust-toolchain.toml, .node-version, .python-version); doctor checks both.
# `<since>` marks a tool the workflow adopts in a later ADR-012 plan step:
# doctor reports it but does not fail while it is missing.
# "present" means any version: Docker Desktop updates itself and the
# repository pins images by digest, not the engine.
#
# Install: rustup (rust-toolchain.toml), nvm/fnm (.node-version),
# `uv python install` (.python-version), Homebrew for uv, just, process-compose.
rustc            1.93.1
node             22.21.0
npm              11.6.2
python           3.11.14
uv               0.12.22
just             1.59.0
process-compose  1.124.0  step-4
docker           present
